{"server":"kr","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-08_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-08","title":"황혼","storyCode":"3-8","avgTag":"작전 전","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"61b4c282b6fed91cfd2311d696e0d15ffe770ece5cdb7c577b0153c8eeced165","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"큭! 적이 또 반격해온다!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"스컬슈레더!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"지금 저 녀석들만 처리하면 우리가 이긴다!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"그래."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"지금은… 싸울 수밖에 없겠어."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"호시구마","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"이 녀석들… 만만치 않은데!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"윽…! 저 방패, 젠장…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"맞아, 저 녀석은… 저 녀석은 근위국의…!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"호시구마","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"지금이라도 무기를 버리고 투항하면 기회를 주도록 하지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"호시구마","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"그러나 죽음을 재촉하고 싶은 녀석이 있다면…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"네 말을 어떻게 믿으라는 거냐?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"속지 마라! 우르수스에서도… 투항한 감염자들은 있었어. 하지만 투항한 후에 한 명씩 차례대로… 결국에는 모두 처형당했지…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"그리고 나는 산처럼 쌓인 시체 속을 기어 나와서 간신히 살아남았다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"호시구마","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"너희가 우리를 없애기 위해… 해왔던 행동이 얼마나 비열했는지는 더 말할 필요도 없겠지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"너희는 우리 감염자들을 모조리 죽일 셈이잖아?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"그렇다면 우리도 끝까지 싸울 거다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"호시구마","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"덩치 큰 언니, 지금 무슨 말을 해도 저 녀석들은 듣지 않을 거야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"지금 저 녀석들은 용문의 착한 사람과, 우르수스의 나쁜 사람도 구분하지 못할 테니까."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"그곳에선… 아니, 어디든 똑같겠구나…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"비감염자와 감염자는 서로 위협하고 증오할 뿐이야. 그거 말곤 없어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"호시구마","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"보아하니… 교섭은 결렬된 것 같군. 눈앞에 길이 열려 있는데도."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"길이라고?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"…우리가 뭘 할 수 있는데?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"너희는 뭘 할 수 있고?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"저런 놈들과 이야기할 필요 없어! 스컬슈레더! 한꺼번에 처치해버리자!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"호시구마","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"폭발인가?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"용문근위국 대원","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"놈들이 사방에서 우리를 포위할 생각인가 봅니다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"이대로 있다간 측면이 버티지 못해… 반격한다!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"스컬슈레더! 내가 엄호하지! 이놈들만 잡으면 이 싸움도 끝이라고!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"스컬슈레더!!!!!!!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"반드시… 모두 함께…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"반드시…!!!!!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"――――――――――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"이제 시간이 얼마 남지 않았다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"호시구마."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"호시구마","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"준비는 되어 있다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"침착하게 행동해. 적에게 약점을 드러내지 마!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"호시구마","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"적에게 기회를 줄 생각은 없다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"용문근위국 대원","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"놈들의 돌격에 주의하십시오!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야! 적에게 너무 다가가면 안 돼…!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"저, 저건……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"전……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"박사님, 박사님… 전 어떻게 하면 좋을까요…"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"네가 해야 할 일을 하는 거다, 아미야.","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"하지만 저는……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"죄송해요. 박사님…… 저……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"아……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야…?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"어째서……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"당신이……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"이런 짓을……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야… 이렇게 될 운명이었던 거야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야! 뭘 하는 거야! 어서……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"전……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"쳇……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"첸 팀장님? 전……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"됐어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"역시……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"모든 것을 끝내야겠군."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……첸 팀장님……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"한 가지 충고해 두지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"지금부터는 모든 감염자를 똑같다고 생각해라. 저들은 모두 적이야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"운명이란 불공평한 법이다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"원망하고 싶으면, 날 원망해라."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"첸","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"근위국, 공격하라!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["아미야"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["첸"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["용문근위국 대원"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["리유니온 멤버"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["프란카"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["첸","호시구마"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["스컬슈레더"]}]}
